{"surface":"எமியமாக","parts":[{"text":"எமியம்","lemma":"எமியம்","gloss":"we who are lonely"},{"text":"ஆக","lemma":"ஆ","gloss":"to become"}],"gloss":"as we are lonely"},{"surface":"ஈங்குத்","parts":[{"text":"ஈங்கு","lemma":"ஈங்கு","gloss":"here"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"consonant doubler"}],"gloss":"here"},{"surface":"துறந்தோர்","parts":[{"text":"துறந்தோர்","lemma":"துறந்தோர்","gloss":"he who abandoned"}],"gloss":"he who abandoned","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தமியராக","parts":[{"text":"தமியர்","lemma":"தமியர்","gloss":"they who are alone"},{"text":"ஆக","lemma":"ஆ","gloss":"to become"}],"gloss":"being alone"},{"surface":"இனியர்கொல்லோ","parts":[{"text":"இனியர்","lemma":"இனியர்","gloss":"happy person"},{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"doubt particle"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"emphasis/question particle"}],"gloss":"is he happy indeed?"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஏழூர்ப்","parts":[{"text":"ஏழ்","lemma":"ஏழ்","gloss":"seven"},{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"village"},{"text":"ப்","lemma":"ப்","gloss":"consonant doubler"}],"gloss":"of seven villages"},{"surface":"பொதுவினைக்கு","parts":[{"text":"பொது","lemma":"பொது","gloss":"common"},{"text":"வினை","lemma":"வினை","gloss":"work"},{"text":"க்கு","lemma":"க்கு","gloss":"dative suffix"}],"gloss":"for common work"},{"surface":"ஓரூர்","parts":[{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ஓர்","gloss":"one"},{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"village"}],"gloss":"one village"},{"surface":"யாத்த","parts":[{"text":"யா","lemma":"யா","gloss":"bind/tie"},{"text":"த்த","lemma":"த்த","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"bound"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உலைவாங்கு","parts":[{"text":"உலை","lemma":"உலை","gloss":"forge"},{"text":"வாங்கு","lemma":"வாங்கு","gloss":"draw/pull"}],"gloss":"forge-drawn"},{"surface":"மிதிதோல்","parts":[{"text":"மிதி","lemma":"மிதி","gloss":"step on"},{"text":"தோல்","lemma":"தோல்","gloss":"leather"}],"gloss":"stepped-on leather bellows"},{"surface":"போலத்","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"போல","gloss":"like"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"consonant doubler"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தலைவரம்பு","parts":[{"text":"தலை","lemma":"தலை","gloss":"head/limit"},{"text":"வரம்பு","lemma":"வரம்பு","gloss":"boundary"}],"gloss":"limit"},{"surface":"அறியாது","parts":[{"text":"அறி","lemma":"அறி","gloss":"know"},{"text":"யாது","lemma":"ஆது","gloss":"negative suffix"}],"gloss":"not knowing"},{"surface":"வருந்தும்","parts":[{"text":"வருந்து","lemma":"வருந்து","gloss":"suffer"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"habitual relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"suffers"},{"surface":"என்னெஞ்சே","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"},{"text":"நெஞ்சு","lemma":"நெஞ்சு","gloss":"heart"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis particle"}],"gloss":"my heart indeed"}]}],"literal":"Spreading strong wings, in swift flight, the bats / go towards fruit-bearing trees in the sorrowful evening. / While we are lonely, he who abandoned us here, / being alone, is he happy? / Like the stepped-on leather bellows drawn in a forge, / tied to one village for the common work of seven villages, / my heart suffers, knowing no limit.","translation":"In the sorrowful evening, bats with wide, strong wings fly swiftly towards fruit-bearing trees. He who abandoned me here to be lonely—is he happy in his solitude? Like the leather bellows of a blacksmith's forge, stepped on and drawn back, bound to one village to do the common work of seven, my heart suffers, knowing no limit to its pain.","modern":"பரந்த வலிமையான இறக்கைகளுடன் வேகமாகப் பறக்கும் வௌவால்கள் பழங்கள் நிறைந்த மரங்களை நோக்கிச் செல்லும் இந்தத் துன்பம் நிறைந்த மாலைப் பொழுதில், என்னை இங்கே தனிமையில் தவிக்கவிட்டுச் சென்றவர், தாம் மட்டும் தனியாக இருந்து இன்பமாக இருக்கிறாரா? ஏழு ஊர்களின் பொதுவான வேலைக்காக ஒரே ஊரில் கட்டப்பட்டு, உலையில் இழுத்து மிதிக்கப்படும் துருத்தித் தோல் போல, என் நெஞ்சம் எல்லையற்ற துன்பத்தை அடைந்து வருந்துகிறது.","explanation":"The heroine (thalaivi) speaks to her confidante (thōḻi) during the painful evening hours in the Neytal (coastal) landscape. She laments the absence of her lover, who has left her alone. She observes the bats flying swiftly to fruit-bearing trees, highlighting how even animals find their destination and comfort in the evening, while she is left desolate. She compares her aching heart to the leather bellows of a blacksmith's forge, which is constantly stepped on and compressed to blow air for seven surrounding villages. Just as the bellows are relentlessly squeezed and released without rest, her heart is continuously crushed by grief and anxiety, knowing no boundary or relief.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.32],[0.32,1.1],[1.1,1.6],[1.6,2.0],[2.0,2.5],[2.5,2.7],[2.7,3.2],[3.2,3.7],[3.7,4.37],[4.37,5.0],[5.08,5.4],[5.4,5.9],[5.9,6.24],[6.36,6.52],[6.52,6.85],[6.85,7.1],[7.44,7.61],[7.61,8.3],[8.87,9.15],[9.15,9.72],[9.72,10.3],[10.3,10.47],[10.8,10.93],[11.07,11.47],[11.47,12.6],[12.6,13.1],[13.15,13.4]],"female":[[0.17,0.33],[0.33,1.2],[1.2,1.7],[1.7,2.1],[2.1,3.1],[3.1,3.3],[3.3,3.8],[3.8,4.4],[4.4,5.07],[5.07,5.8],[5.88,6.2],[6.2,6.8],[6.8,7.19],[7.31,7.7],[7.7,8.1],[8.1,8.77],[8.77,9.66],[9.66,10.1],[10.5,10.7],[10.7,11.1],[11.1,11.68],[11.8,12.3],[12.3,12.77],[12.77,13.6],[13.69,14.2],[14.2,15.0],[15.07,15.4]]},"sync":[[["தாஅ","spreading wide"]],[["வலஞ்சிறை","strong wings"]],[["நொப்பறை","swift flight"]],[["வாவல்","bats"]],[["பழுமரம்","fruit-bearing tree"]],[["படரும்","seeking"]],[["பையுன்","sorrowful"]],[["மாலை","evening"]],[["எமியமாக","as we are lonely"]],[["எமியமாக","as we are lonely"]],[["ஈங்குத்","here"]],[["துறந்தோர்","he who abandoned"]],[["தமியராக","being alone"]],[["தமியராக","being alone"]],[["இனியர்கொல்லோ","is he happy indeed?"]],[["இனியர்கொல்லோ","is he happy indeed?"]],[["ஏழூர்ப்","of seven villages"]],[["பொதுவினைக்கு","for common work"]],[["பொதுவினைக்கு","for common work"],["ஓரூர்","one village"]],[["யாத்த","bound"]],[["உலைவாங்கு","forge-drawn"]],[["மிதிதோல்","stepped-on leather bellows"]],[["போலத்","like"]],[["தலைவரம்பு","limit"]],[["தலைவரம்பு","limit"],["அறியாது","not knowing"]],[["வருந்தும்","suffers"],["என்னெஞ்சே","my heart indeed"]],[["என்னெஞ்சே","my heart indeed"]]]}